49601", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9717/8722/272263_normal.png?m=1789549601", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9717/8722/272263_large.png?m=1789549601", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9717/8722/272263_xlarge.png?m=1789549601", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9717/8722/272263_xxlarge.png?m=1789549601", "created": 1512379232, "last_modified": 1789549601, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "xyooyx", "last_touched": 1789578723, "title": "我的 v 站余额是什么水平？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1242483", "created": 1789549845, "deleted": 0, "content": "我是 V2EX 第 272263 号会员，加入于 2017-12-04 17:20:32 +08:00\r\n\r\n目前账号 1 金 35 银 1 铜，余额来源基本都是签到来的，中间有几年 gap 没坐班没怎么上 v 站\r\n\r\n想知道我是属于垫底还是中间？大家会有余额焦虑吗，会因为余额不足不轻易发帖/回复吗？", "content_rendered": "我是 V2EX 第 272263 号会员，加入于 2017-12-04 17:20:32 +08:00<br /><br />目前账号 1 金 35 银 1 铜，余额来源基本都是签到来的，中间有几年 gap 没坐班没怎么上 v 站<br /><br />想知道我是属于垫底还是中间？大家会有余额焦虑吗，会因为余额不足不轻易发帖/回复吗？", "last_modified": 1789549845, "replies": 69, "id": 1242483}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 11701, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2470, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 605355, "username": "selfly", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/selfly", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0a8ca6365a2bb5a2513ca8c24a236700?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0a8ca6365a2bb5a2513ca8c24a236700?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0a8ca6365a2bb5a2513ca8c24a236700?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1670480426, "last_modified": 1783561530, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "wizChen", "last_touched": 1789577038, "title": "大家对骚扰电话有什么好的屏蔽办法", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1242300", "created": 1789521050, "deleted": 0, "content": "如题，一天天骚扰电话不断，\r\n\r\n各种贷款推销，小孩课程推荐，各大信用卡中心推销，其它广告等等，\r\n\r\n有时候真的特别懊恼，比如以下场景：\r\n\r\n1.工作原因开热点，好好跑个任务来个推销电话，网断联了(双卡，用副卡网络，副卡来电不断网，另一张来电会断，双模单通)\r\n\r\n2.午休被吵醒，一接推销电话\r\n\r\n3.小电驴上下班在路上飙呢，停车减速戴着头盔很不便(下雨天加倍)，一顿操作结果一接推销电话\r\n\r\n以上三个是本人遇到最多最火大的场景，\r\n\r\n能识别并自动屏蔽掉的始终只有一小部分，\r\n\r\n想要开启只接联系人来电，但是快递、外卖这些也就接不到了，再加偶尔会有真的来电，\r\n\r\n不胜其扰，各位都有什么好的办法？", "content_rendered": "<p>如题，一天天骚扰电话不断，</p>\n<p>各种贷款推销，小孩课程推荐，各大信用卡中心推销，其它广告等等，</p>\n<p>有时候真的特别懊恼，比如以下场景：</p>\n<p>1.工作原因开热点，好好跑个任务来个推销电话，网断联了(双卡，用副卡网络，副卡来电不断网，另一张来电会断，双模单通)</p>\n<p>2.午休被吵醒，一接推销电话</p>\n<p>3.小电驴上下班在路上飙呢，停车减速戴着头盔很不便(下雨天加倍)，一顿操作结果一接推销电话</p>\n<p>以上三个是本人遇到最多最火大的场景，</p>\n<p>能识别并自动屏蔽掉的始终只有一小部分，</p>\n<p>想要开启只接联系人来电，但是快递、外卖这些也就接不到了，再加偶尔会有真的来电，</p>\n<p>不胜其扰，各位都有什么好的办法？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1789531363, "replies": 64, "id": 1242300}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/f749/09ac/430_large.png?m=1730010328", "name": "icloud", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/f749/09ac/430_normal.png?m=1730010328", "title": "iCloud", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/icloud", "topics": 1648, "footer": "", "header": "Store contacts, calendars, photos, music, books, apps and more in the cloud and access them on all your devices.", "title_alternative": "iCloud", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/f749/09ac/430_mini.png?m=1730010328", "stars": 323, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 430, "parent_node_name": "apple"}, "member": {"id": 537311, "username": "seekme", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/seekme", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9cce/f7af/537311_mini.png?m=1789520731", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9cce/f7af/537311_normal.png?m=1789520731", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9cce/f7af/537311_large.png?m=1789520731", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9cce/f7af/537311_xlarge.png?m=1789520731", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9cce/f7af/537311_xxlarge.png?m=1789520731", "created": 1615553372, "last_modified": 1789520731, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "KoreaFish", "last_touched": 1789577945, "title": "即日起 iCloud+用户可免费享受 TV 和 Arcade", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1242299", "created": 1789520859, "deleted": 0, "content": "即日起 iCloud+用户可免费享受 TV 和 Arcade\r\n\r\n包括乞丐版 50G ，相当于一年不到 18 新币（ rmb100 块钱）就可以享受到附加服务。\r\n支持一百多个国家，但不包括国区日区跟美区。\r\n\r\nhttps://www.icloud.com/en-sg/info/icloud-plus-tv-arcade\r\n\r\n想问一下大家，充值的话，土区方便还是新加坡区方便，推荐土区还是新加坡区呢。", "content_rendered": "<p>即日起 iCloud+用户可免费享受 TV 和 Arcade</p>\n<p>包括乞丐版 50G ，相当于一年不到 18 新币（ rmb100 块钱）就可以享受到附加服务。\n支持一百多个国家，但不包括国区日区跟美区。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.icloud.com/en-sg/info/icloud-plus-tv-arcade\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.icloud.com/en-sg/info/icloud-plus-tv-arcade</a></p>\n<p>想问一下大家，充值的话，土区方便还是新加坡区方便，推荐土区还是新加坡区呢。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1789520859, "replies": 61, "id": 1242299}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/38af/8613/176_large.png?m=1644885960", "name": "car", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/38af/8613/176_normal.png?m=1644885960", "title": "汽车", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/car", "topics": 3304, "footer": "", "header": "关于买车、开车及汽车文化的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Car", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/38af/8613/176_mini.png?m=1644885960", "stars": 2301, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 176, "parent_node_name": "life"}, "member": {"id": 417968, "username": "emmmbu", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/emmmbu", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b7244fe840eeecb7c5521d370633582d?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b7244fe840eeecb7c5521d370633582d?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b7244fe840eeecb7c5521d370633582d?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1559487097, "last_modified": 1559487097, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "Maxbee", "last_touched": 1789582241, "title": "今晚发布的理想 i9 请教下看法", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1242417", "created": 1789539155, "deleted": 0, "content": "最近考虑买辆电车，已婚有娃。\r\n\r\n• 特某拉、某界，首先排除\r\n\r\n• 小米汽车：热度很高，但除去情绪价值，综合性价比个人感觉并不是很高\r\n\r\n• 极氪：硬件底子不错，但比较担心车机系统稳定性，怕后续出现各类小 bug\r\n\r\n• 蔚来：智驾表现一般，换电模式网上评价两极\r\n\r\n重中之重的一点，考虑到 L3 明年政策落地，这些品牌不太清楚是否满足 L3 的要求，不希望买了就淘汰。\r\n\r\n目前看中理想 i9 旋转座椅、空间大，理想车机口碑比较好，整体配置不低，内饰用料感觉也不错，智驾应该算一梯队，并且配有线控底盘和后轮转向，听说 L3 的硬件要求之一就是线控底盘？\r\n\r\ni9 是否满足 L3 的硬件，以及是否推荐或者是否有其他选项推荐。想听听佬们的看法。\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n特某拉、问界", "content_rendered": "<p>最近考虑买辆电车，已婚有娃。</p>\n<p>• 特某拉、某界，首先排除</p>\n<p>• 小米汽车：热度很高，但除去情绪价值，综合性价比个人感觉并不是很高</p>\n<p>• 极氪：硬件底子不错，但比较担心车机系统稳定性，怕后续出现各类小 bug</p>\n<p>• 蔚来：智驾表现一般，换电模式网上评价两极</p>\n<p>重中之重的一点，考虑到 L3 明年政策落地，这些品牌不太清楚是否满足 L3 的要求，不希望买了就淘汰。</p>\n<p>目前看中理想 i9 旋转座椅、空间大，理想车机口碑比较好，整体配置不低，内饰用料感觉也不错，智驾应该算一梯队，并且配有线控底盘和后轮转向，听说 L3 的硬件要求之一就是线控底盘？</p>\n<p>i9 是否满足 L3 的硬件，以及是否推荐或者是否有其他选项推荐。想听听佬们的看法。</p>\n<p>特某拉、问界</p>\n", "last_modified": 1789539155, "replies": 56, "id": 1242417}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_large.png?m=1751736785", "name": "openai", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_normal.png?m=1751736785", "title": "OpenAI", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai", "topics": 4767, "footer": "", "header": "关于 OpenAI 旗下产品 GPT，DALL·E，和 ChatGPT 的讨论。请不要在 V2EX 的回复中粘贴复制来自 AI 生成的文本。", "title_alternative": "OpenAI", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785", "stars": 3352, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1135, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 768070, "username": "GhostCai", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/GhostCai", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/59f6/c86e/768070_mini.png?m=1787897766", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/59f6/c86e/768070_normal.png?m=1787897766", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/59f6/c86e/768070_large.png?m=1787897766", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/59f6/c86e/768070_xlarge.png?m=1787897766", "created": 1758624964, "last_modified": 1787897766, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "cellsyx", "last_touched": 1789585276, "title": "发现 6 astra 无限能源了", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1242432", "created": 1789540820, "deleted": 0, "content": "最近要写东西，想起来 openai 之前搞的那个 latex 编辑器 prism.openai.com ，惊觉里面可以用稳定不降智的 6 astra xhigh ，实测不占 codex 额度，估计是官方都忘了这个平台了。。", "content_rendered": "<p>最近要写东西，想起来 openai 之前搞的那个 latex 编辑器 <a href=\"http://prism.openai.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">prism.openai.com</a> ，惊觉里面可以用稳定不降智的 6 astra xhigh ，实测不占 codex 额度，估计是官方都忘了这个平台了。。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1789540820, "replies": 48, "id": 1242432}]